# CLI Documentation

When adding or changing a `rose` CLI command:

1. Update `.cursor/skills/rose/SKILL.md` — agent-facing reference (flags, TTY requirements, workflows)
2. Update `README.md` — user-facing install/upgrade/skill install and command docs

Both files should reflect the same command surface. Prefer documenting non-interactive flags for agent use.
